flowchart TD
 U[Incoming task] --> R[Intent router]
 R -->|One capability| W[Allow-listed worker]
 R -->|Composite task| S[Supervisor]
 S --> P[Bounded delegation plan]
 P --> F[Parallel independent workers]
 F --> A[Aggregator with partial failure]
 A --> H[Hierarchical synthesis]
 H --> C[Evidence critic]
 C -->|Revision budget remains| H
 C -->|Pass or budget exhausted| O[Validated output]
 E[Domain event] --> D[Deduplicate tenant and event ID]
 D -->|New| X[Handler and durable state]
 D -->|Duplicate| Z[Return prior result]
